  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alola!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F006C00610021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m with CHARGE—the Committee to Highlight\nAlolan Raichu and Generate Excitement!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOur goal is to increase the popularity—and the\npopulation—of Alolan Raichu.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...Well, I say “our” goal, but I’m the only member\nof the committee for now.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In any case, are you familiar with regional forms?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMaybe? Maybe not? Either way, here’s the scoop.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know how some Pokémon’s looks can be\ninfluenced by the region they live in, right?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, in Alola, even the Pikachu we all know and\nlove evolve into a different form of Raichu!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rather than me explaining the differences, why\nnot try comparing the two yourself?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I know just how you should do it!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLet’s have a Pokémon battle between your Raichu\nand my Alolan Raichu!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once you’re ready to test your Raichu against my\nAlolan Raichu, just come and let me know.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you have a Raichu, I’d love to battle it with my\nAlolan Raichu. Make sure you only have a Raichu<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin your party—I’ll do the same.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, if it isn’t an Alolan Raichu! What a treat! But\nfor our battle, you need just a Raichu.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, you brought a Raichu! Well then, care to\nbattle my Alolan Raichu?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C00200079006F0075002000620072006F00750067006800740020006100200052006100690063006800750021002000570065006C006C0020007400680065006E002C0020006300610072006500200074006F000A0062006100740074006C00650020006D007900200041006C006F006C0061006E0020005200610069006300680075003F001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Absolutely!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100620073006F006C007500740065006C007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aw, I hope you reconsider! It’s really important for\nmy—I mean, for CHARGE’s mission!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Both Raichu have their charms, but the Alolan\nform has a different type—that means different<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nstrengths and weaknesses. Stay on your toes!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What a spectacular victory! But don’t go\nassuming we’re done here yet.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe Committee to Highlight Alolan Raichu and\nGenerate Excitement has one last thing to offer...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 174
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s trade: your Raichu for my Alolan Raichu!\nWhat do you say?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007420190073002000740072006100640065003A00200079006F00750072002000520061006900630068007500200066006F00720020006D007900200041006C006F006C0061006E00200052006100690063006800750021000A005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020007300610079003F001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s trade",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650074201900730020007400720061006400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007400680061006E006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s too bad. Well, CHARGE will always be here\nwaiting if you change your mind!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trading Raichu is how we’ll spread the joy of the\nAlolan regional form!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I completely understand! Pokémon trades can be\nso agonizing, can’t they?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know, the Alolan form is lovely, of course, but\njust plain Raichu are pretty adorable, too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rararaaai!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520061007200610072006100610061006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well then, I’m off on another journey!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’ll travel over to Alola, befriend a bunch of Alolan\nRaichu, and spread their cuteness all around the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nworld... That’s what CHARGE is all about!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
